; Primary source: Jacob Gunness (1993), Classic Adventures Solution
; Archive https://solutionarchive.com/file/id,401/ (also The Tipshop).
; Not playthrough-verified.

[Solution:overview:Overview]

Recover the Jewels of Babylon from the island and return them to your
ship.

Primary walkthrough: Jacob Gunness (1993) via the Classic Adventures
Solution Archive (file id 401).

#LIST
{ Save often - pirates can kill you }
{ The map is full of useless red-herring objects }
LIST#

[Solution:notes-danger:Hazards And Red Herrings]

Gunness: save regularly; nasty pirates may kill you. The game is
flooded with useless objects - ignore extras that are not on this
route. Tips also note giving the watch to the native, fish to the lion,
killing the octopus with the spear, crowbar for the boulder/stone, rod
for the rock door, and shouting in the canyon for the crab.

